            "notes": "Unprocessed recordings (raw/set/sub-XXX), referential montage (all 19 channels carry signal, Cz included); derivatives/ (their filtered, ASR/ICA-cleaned version) is on disk but unused. Per-subject label: loso only. 10 s windows as EEG-FM-Bench."
